    {
      "text": "Pineco hangs from a tree branch and patiently waits for prey to come along. If the Pokémon is disturbed while eating by someone shaking its tree, it drops down to the ground and explodes with no warning.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Motionless, it hangs from trees, waiting for its bug Pokémon prey to come to it. Its favorite in Alola is Cutiefly.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sticks tree bark to itself with its saliva, making itself thicker and larger. Elderly Pineco are ridiculously huge.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
